  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given that <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous in the interval <math><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></math>, so, it will be continuous at&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br /><br />Now <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">x&nbsp;</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math> (rationalizing)<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math> (<math><mo>∵</mo></math> <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is continuous at point 0)<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
